  "title": "EZ Peanut Butter Pie I",
  "description": "This pie is somewhere between a cream cheese pie and a peanut butter pie. If you like either, you &#39;ll love this simple-to-make frozen pie. Creamy peanut butter is stirred into a mixture of cream cheese, sugar and vanilla. Then whipped topping is stirred into that, and this yummy filling is spooned into a prepared crust and frozen.",
